      "message": "I\u0027m not following what you\u0027re trying to convey.\n\nTo recap:\n\n1. `physicalMemory` property of `NSProcessInfo` is defined as `unsigned long long` (not as `NSUInteger` as you did)\n2. In touchHLE, C type of `unsigned long long` is repesented as Rust type of `u64`\n\nYou could learn more about touchHLE types here https://github.com/touchHLE/touchHLE/issues/48.\nYou could also check existing code examples, such as this one https://github.com/touchHLE/touchHLE/blob/caa342a77a6528505372a0a107d18fd220d2be13/src/frameworks/foundation/ns_value.rs#L268.",
